ge would have been brave enough to red flag Pedraza in front of 80,000 cheering spectators. Pedraza caught Smaga on the last turn and then began closing on Holubnychiy, and was by now in almost a full sprint. But Holubnychiy held off Pedraza, saving the officials from making a difficult decision. The three medalists finished within five seconds of one another."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button143552", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button143552').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "5 km"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "10 km"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "15 km"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "803"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77438"} "Vladimir Golubnichy"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "1-33:58.4"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "23:12.0 (3)"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "46:54.4 (2)"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "1-10:19.0 (=1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "620"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/73552"} "José Pedraza"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MEX"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/MEX.png"}] "MEX"]] [:td {} "1-34:00.0"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "23:16.0 (7)"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "47:13.0 (4)"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "1-10:54.0 (4)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""